  "description": "Start your BMX journey the right way with the Revo line. Built to deliver an authentic freestyle riding experience, the Revo combines durability, performance, and incredible value in one complete package. Every component has been carefully selected to ensure the bike is ready to shred straight out of the box, easy to maintain, and upgradeable as your skills progress. Loaded with features like 25-9 gearing, tapered fork legs, and short, responsive pro-inspired geometry, the Revo is designed to help riders progress faster and have more fun doing it.\nThe Revo 20\" PRO FS builds on the proven Revo 20\"\" PRO with the addition of a front U-brake and rotor system, offering riders greater versatility and progression potential. Designed for those ready to explore the full spectrum of freestyle BMX, it delivers a more dialled setup straight out of the box.",
